## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Verify that the nearest deadline is correctly calculated and displayed for each module.
- Test hover interactions to ensure button overlays are smooth and don't flicker.
- Check that the grid adapts correctly to 1-column vs 2-column dashboard slots.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
-   Switch between modules in the sidebar and verify the detail pane updates correctly.
-   Verify all links (Canvas, Details, Tasks) are functional.
-   Test the "Manage" view toggle and module visibility updates.
-   Verify aesthetics (transparency, blurs, and animations) look premium.
